Source: https://github.com/jdx/hk/blob/main/src/step/runner.rs

Step commands receive only step-level `env` config and (optionally) mise environment variables. No `GIT_INDEX_FILE` or `GIT_OBJECT_DIRECTORY` is injected by hk — hook steps always operate on the real working tree and default index.

