### hk > Execution Safety

Source: https://github.com/jdx/hk/blob/main/test/snapshots/agent/instructions-codex.txt

Always inspect the potential effects of a command before execution. Prioritize the use of the --safe flag and avoid running unknown or destructive commands without explicit user approval. After applying fixes, review the resulting diff to ensure accuracy.

