Source: https://github.com/jdx/hk/blob/main/docs/cli/run/commit-msg.md

Execution behavior can be customized with flags for fail-fast logic, step-specific execution, and stash methods. The --safe flag provides a layer of protection by rejecting commands with unknown or potentially destructive effects before they are executed.

