cpp-linter	fail	29s	https://github.com/xifan2333/fcitx5-vinput/actions/runs/33698812644/job/100473404110	
build-linux	pass	2m59s	https://github.com/xifan2333/fcitx5-vinput/actions/runs/33698812626/job/100473404032	
